Lets the backend report each repeat of a held keyboard key that the system makes, with io.ConfigKeyRepeatFromBackend, which turns off the repeats that Dear ImGui makes for keyboard keys, and lets InputText apply an editing key once for each press in the frame, so a held key follows the key repeat of the system at any framerate.

